# Remediation safety

- Compile typed actions only. Reject raw command strings.
- Bind approval to an immutable proposal digest. Any param change voids the approval.
- Expired or already-executed proposals cannot run again.
- Approver cannot be the system Agent. Reject cannot be auto-overridden.
- Executor allowlist: rollback, restart, scale. Namespace/service must be allowlisted.
- Load `skills/remediation-safety/SKILL.md` before changing this path.
